@name armory
@size 16x24
@anchor 8,24
@scale 12
@palette
K #242734 outline
n #e0e2d2 steel edge
m #a1b4bd steel
M #546776 steel shadow
t #cfac65 brass
T #795b3f brass shadow
u #976b45 wood
U #513d31 wood shadow
v #c09a66 wood light
x #8bc5ca rune
X #4b727d rune shadow
@lint skip=doubles,light,jaggy
# Narrow steel edges and hooked/serrated silhouettes use deliberate one-pixel intersections.
# Upper-left material highlights are authored; long single-pixel shafts have no planar light gradient.

